        name: `The Queen Sessions | Marisa Cristina Blake - Latin Jazz`,
        sort_time: "2026-11-25 19:00:00",
        end_time_formatted: "2026-11-25 23:59",
        detail: "The Queen Sessions | Marisa Cristina Blake - Latin Jazz Wed, Nov 25 The Queen Sessions at Hotel Eve | A celebration of the legendary women who shaped jazz. \n \n Marisa Cristina Blake is a 20+ year veteran of the Asheville music scene. She performs on vocals and percussion in various projects in the area. In this special rendition of “The Queen Sessions,” Marisa and her band will transport you to the vibrant streets of Havana, Cuba, for an evening celebrating the rich sounds and rhythms of Cuban and Latin Jazz. Inspired by legendary artists such as Omara Portuondo, celebrated for her work with the Buena Vista Social Club, and the iconic Celia Cruz. \n \n Featuring: \n Ozzie Orengo: Percussion \n Ben Bjorlie: Bass \n Josh Blake: Guitar \n Juca Camera: Piano \n \n The evening will blend beloved Cuban classics with a few original compositions, creating a soulful and intimate experience. \n \n Join us Wednesday, November 25, at Hotel Eve for a captivating evening of rhythm, tradition, and the timeless spirit of musica Cubana. \n \n $10/Door: Reserve your seats here ~ capacity is limited. \n 07:00 PM SHOW 08:30 PM SHOW",
