        start_time: "7:30PM",
        end_time: "?",
        name: `Voctave: We Need a Little Christmas`,
        sort_time: "2026-12-01 19:30:00",
        end_time_formatted: "2026-12-01 23:59",
        detail: "A cappella sensation Voctave “bring a cappella music to a new dimension” (Jazz Weekly). This 11-member vocal ensemble performs beloved popular songs with intricate, irresistible harmonies. Their holiday spectacular We Need a Little Christmas includes a stocking full of holiday favorites from their chart-topping album. \n\nVoctave’s members come from a variety of musical backgrounds, giving the group a rich, unique a cappella sound. \nEsteemed producer Jamey Ray founded the group in Florida in 2015. \nVoctave have released 13 studio albums and collaborated with Tituss Burgess, The Swingles, and Pentatonix’s Kristin Maldonado.",
