        name: `Trivia Night`,
        sort_time: "2026-12-02 19:00:00",
        end_time_formatted: "2026-12-02 20:30",
        detail: "Join us for free live trivia every Wednesday at 7pm at Guidon Brewing Company in Hendersonville, NC with Not Rocket Science Trivia! Free to play, and top teams win gift card prizes! Want an edge? Sign up now to get 3 free trivia clues before the game: https://www.notrocketsciencetrivia.com/trivia-clues",
