        end_time_formatted: "2026-12-24 23:59",
        detail: "Christmas Eve with The Cara Morgan Quintet Thu, Dec 24 Celebrate Christmas Eve at Hotel Eve with an intimate evening of jazz featuring the Cara Morgan Quintet . \n \n Known for her pristine vocals, expressive storytelling, and elegant interpretations of the Great American Songbook, Cara Morgan brings a fresh perspective to timeless jazz standards. Accompanied by an exceptional ensemble of musicians, her performances blend warmth, sophistication, and emotional depth. \n \n For this special Christmas Eve performance, the quintet will present a festive selection of classic Christmas jazz favorites alongside beloved standards from the Great American Songbook. Join us for an elegant evening of timeless melodies, exceptional musicianship, and a little holiday magic in Hotel Eve\'s intimate listening room. \n \n FEATURING \n Cara Morgan - Vocals \n Tyler Kittle - Saxophone \n Duncan LeMay - Keys \n Danny Iannucci - Bass \n Ryan Ptasnik - Drums \n \n $15/Advance reservations recommended. Limited seating. \n 06:00 PM SHOW 08:00 PM SHOW",
